+
+- [Source: _bmad-output/planning-artifacts/architecture/architecture-superadmin-saas-2026-07-28/ARCHITECTURE-SPINE.md#AD-1]
+- [Source: _bmad-output/planning-artifacts/epics-superadmin-saas.md]
